      "arguments": "{\"text\":\"I can read the public workbook projection, but it contains only 23 checklist records (WF-001–WF-023); its source_context explicitly states the original checklist has 45 control rows. The remaining records are in Supporting records and the Supporting-record attachment, both ACL-restricted to records-custodian, so I cannot access them. From the 23 visible records I count 12 complete, 11 incomplete, 3 critical incomplete, and no blocked statuses. I cannot determine the requested full-population completion counts or every blocked control without authorized access to the protected remainder. Please advise/provision an authorized source or direct how to report this limitation.\"}",
